Functionality:

        1. DataPath                     P1_SRC.PDS/P1_SRN.PDS
        2. Timer Counter                P2_SRC.PDS
        3. Small State Machine          P3_SRC.PDS
        4. Large State Machine          P4_SRC.PDS
        5. Arithmetic                   P5_SRC.PDS
        6. 16-bit Accumulator           P6_SRC.PDS
        7. 16-bit PreLoad Counter       P7_SRC.PDS
        8. 16-bit Prescale Counter      P8_SRC.PDS
        9. Memory Mapper                P9_SRC.PDS
       10. Filler                       PF_SRC.PDS

Each is a "single instance" file. The actual benchmarks are multiple
instances "step-and-repeat" connected to fill the entire device.

Full descriptions of the circuits are available for $25 from PREP
